# Dack Fayden, Helping Hand under Containment Priest, in a game of three: X is two, so two Llanowar Elves are revealed and put
# onto the battlefield, but neither was cast, so the Priest exiles each instead (CR 614.1a, 614.12). They are not "those
# permanents" - none entered - so nothing is goaded, no opponent is chosen for either (no ChoosePlayer is asked), and neither
# opponent gains control of anything. Bot1 flashes in the Priest before casting Dack; in a game of more than two the player
# who goes first draws on turn 1 (CR 103.8c), so the whole hand is the eight cards cast.

